    <string name="welcome_title">Privacy Policy</string>
    <string name="welcome_body">Welcome to LED Notify!\n\nYour privacy is our absolute priority:\n• The app does NOT use an internet connection (internet permission is completely absent in the manifest).\n• No data, notification texts, or personal info are collected, stored, or sent to any external servers.\n• All processing happens 100% locally on your device solely to illuminate the notification ring around the camera.\n\nBy continuing, you agree to these terms.</string>
